nightly: "a5cb6bb pushed to nightly; CI success; npm dist-tag nightly = 0.2.51-nightly.20261010-050702.a5cb6bb (the nightly publish job was still in its post-publish steps when the local install ran)."
main: "origin/main had no commits missing from nightly (0 main-only, 6 nightly-only), so main was fast-forwarded c57810d -> a5cb6bb after the nightly CI passed. main CI success; main 'Publish to npm' success with 'Package @one-ciel-ai/ciel-runtime@0.2.51 is already published; skipping npm publish' - npm latest stays 0.2.51, nothing new reached stable installs. Open PR #3 (base main) is not merged."
local: "npm install -g @one-ciel-ai/ciel-runtime@0.2.51-nightly.20261010-050702.a5cb6bb; install.ps1 with CIEL_RUNTIME_INSTALL_HOME=~/.local/share/ciel-runtime-a5cb6bb9a6fa506eeee09c62a1abfbb5077693e2 (a first run used a wrong full SHA in the folder name; that folder, created minutes earlier by this install, was removed). HKCU CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME points to the a5cb6bb snapshot; ciel-runtimectl version prints the nightly; the snapshot has the new menu; tool guard equals the package copy; router 9611 200. Running sessions keep their launch-time code."
tests_note: "Before the push: unit/runtime/router OK; channel BoundaryScanDeadlineTests fail intermittently on this PC, also on the committed HEAD e7f4169 (see ../../features/session-backup/menu-targets-and-incremental.okf). CI passed on both branches."
